#: includes/class-epay-paycenter-plugin.php:699
msgid "The bank rejected this store's Ticketing Web Service credentials (ResultCode 100, Authentication Error). No payment can be started while this lasts: every customer choosing this payment method will see a failure. Check the Username and Password on the gateway settings screen against the values issued by Euronet Merchant Services, and remember that the environment (Test / Live) has its own separate credentials."
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: date and time the failures began, in UTC. 2: description returned by the bank.
#: includes/class-epay-paycenter-plugin.php:707
msgid "First seen: %1$s UTC. Bank response: %2$s"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epay-paycenter-plugin.php:714
msgid "Check the gateway credentials"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epay-paycenter-plugin.php:717
msgid "This notice disappears on its own as soon as a payment is successfully started, so there is nothing to dismiss once the credentials are corrected."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epay-paycenter-plugin.php:729
msgid "ePay Paycenter for WooCommerce requires WooCommerce to be installed and active."
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: number of hours the payment attempt has been open, 2: MerchantReference of the attempt.
#: includes/class-epay-paycenter-reconciliation.php:218
msgid "Paycenter reconciliation: a payment was started for this order more than %1$d hours ago and no final response was ever received. The order status has deliberately NOT been changed, because without the bank's follow-up Web Service the plugin cannot tell an abandoned checkout from a completed payment whose callback was lost. Check MerchantReference %2$s in the epay eCommerce AdminTool: if the transaction settled, mark this order paid; if not, it can be cancelled."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epay-paycenter-reconciliation.php:370
msgid "ePay Paycenter: payments started but never confirmed"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %d: number of orders with an unconfirmed payment attempt.
#: includes/class-epay-paycenter-reconciliation.php:375
msgid "%d order has a Paycenter payment that was started but for which no final response was ever received. The order status has not been changed automatically, because the plugin cannot tell an abandoned checkout from a completed payment whose callback was lost."
msgid_plural "%d orders have a Paycenter payment that was started but for which no final response was ever received. Their statuses have not been changed automatically, because the plugin cannot tell an abandoned checkout from a completed payment whose callback was lost."
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#: includes/class-epay-paycenter-reconciliation.php:385
msgid "Check each one in the epay eCommerce AdminTool. If the transaction settled, mark the order paid; if it did not, the order can be cancelled. Each affected order carries a note with its MerchantReference."
msgstr ""

